#: templates/admin/plugins/fields/edit.php:263
msgid ""
"Some plugins declare <code>[shortcodes]</code> that you can use in the Post "
"editor.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThese shortcodes are commonly used to embed 3rd party "
"content, like videos or maps. If you\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tthink the shortcodes provided by the selected plugin are "
"going to load a resource from another\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\twebsite, you should probably block them preemptively."
msgstr ""
"Algunos complementos declaran <code>[shortcodes]</code> que se pueden usar "
"en el editor de entradas.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEstos shortcodes se utilizan comúnmente para incrustar "
"contenido de terceros, como videos o mapas. Si cree\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tque los shortcodes proporcionados por el complemento "
"seleccionado van a cargar un recurso de otro\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tsitio web, probablemente debería bloquearlos de manera "
"preventiva."

